      "side": 1,
      "message": "When a watch is connected during a call via a HFP, the audio would be routed to the watch for a while and then back to previous HFP device.\n\nAm I correct? If so, are there any possible way to prevent this case?",
      "revId": "3a1ad8882b628ad20282cf425bda92b016bdcb69",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
